--- A support agent over a shop's orders — Crow's fourth reference app
--- (docs/agents-design.md, Traces, evals and a page). The model runs three
--- tools over a SQLite database of orders, the refund behind the program's
--- gate; every run's steps are written to the database as its trace, and
--- a page shows the runs, their steps, their tokens and their latency. The
--- tests replay what a recording kept (crow test --fixtures), a model
--- grading the answers among them.
use web, ui
use agent.store
use agent.chat
use agent.trace

store.setup[store.book]

serve[3530]
page['/', chat.render]
page['/runs', trace.render]
